# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working documents, not research code.
#
# `ENVIO_KAGGLE.md` documents a submission whose model bundles are not
# distributed here, so it would only point a reader at paths that do not exist.
#
# `IMPROVEMENTS.md` is the internal code-review log. Its findings drove the
# rewrite, but it navigates by notebook section markers and script names that
# no longer exist, so as a published document it would mostly send a reader to
# dead ends.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/tools/
/ENVIO_KAGGLE.md
/IMPROVEMENTS.md

# Local agent / editor configuration.
.claude/
.github/instructions/
